  "description": "Clean mono sine sub at the played pitch under a soft two-harmonic mid one octave up (Harmonic Rise through an LP12 with a short envelope pluck). No distortion, phase reset on every note, mono below 120 Hz. Play: mono legato lines around F0-C2, on its own for halftime/dub or as the low layer under a growl. Tweak: Sub Level for weight, Osc A Index and Vol for how much mid reads on small speakers, Filter Env Amt for the attack. Macro plan (not wired yet): Weight = Sub Level, Tone = Osc A Index + Filter A Freq, Punch = Filter Env Amt, Glide = Portamento.",
